eak-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* O.S: Android 11.0 The latest Android set-top box system, is more stable, safer and more energy efficient</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* Storage: RAM 4G/8G ROM 32G/64G</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* Wireless: 2.4G&amp;5.8G Wifi</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* USB: 1 High speed USB 3.0 \uff0c1 USB 2.0</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* Bluetooth: BT4.0</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* LAN: Ethernet:10/100/1000 standard RJ-45</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\">* HDMI-compatible: HDMI 2.0a up to 4K@60fps</p>\n<p style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-